  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 13th level, the maximum miss chance he can gain from his cunning celerity ability increases to 50%, or 75% if the bravo moves at least 10 feet on his turn.</p>\n<p>Additionally, the bravo can expend his martial focus or an incredible stunt as a swift action to replenish 50% to his dodge pool (or 100% if he spends both as a single swift action) as long as he is currently in combat with a challenging foe (challenge rating no lower than his level – 2) or in comparable danger; he cannot recover dodge pool this way if the combat proves no threat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bravo#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
